---
import PageLayout from '../../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import IndustryResources from '../../../components/IndustryResources.astro';
import RosemarySelection from '../../../components/RosemarySelection.astro';
import ApplicationTasks from '../../../components/ApplicationTasks.astro';
---
<PageLayout title="食品应用" lang="zh" heroTitle="食品应用" heroSubtitle="从应用条件到采购规格">
<ApplicationTasks lang="zh" industry="food" />
<section class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-4xl">
<p class="text-xl text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-10">评估加工性能前，应核对原料身份以及在食品类别和目标市场中的使用许可。</p>
<h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold mb-6">应用排查与验证</h2><div class="space-y-5">
<div class="p-6 bg-off-white rounded-xl"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">分布不均</h3><p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">比较粒径、预混、载体和加料顺序。在中试规模验证混合均匀度，而非只依赖少量实验室样品。</p></div>
<div class="p-6 bg-off-white rounded-xl"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">加工后风味或颜色损失</h3><p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">在实际加热、水分及储存条件下评估完整配方。放大前先确定可接受的感官与外观限值。</p></div>
<div class="p-6 bg-off-white rounded-xl"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">规格不匹配</h3><p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">索取载体、过敏原及相关污染物限值资料。由负责目标市场的团队核对标签与原料适用性。</p></div>
</div><div class="mt-10 p-8 bg-primary/5 rounded-xl"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">准备哪些信息？</h2><p class="mt-3 text-gray-700">食品类别、配方体系、加工条件、添加量、过敏原限制、包装及市场。</p><p class="mt-3 text-gray-600">请同时提供产品、首单数量及所需文件。规格、样品和文件以实际可提供情况为准；认证及合规性需按产品和市场核查。以下建议为评估方向，不是配方或适用性保证。</p><a href="/zh/request-quote?request=application&amp;source=food&amp;application=food" class="inline-block mt-5 px-6 py-3 bg-primary text-white rounded-lg">提交应用需求</a><a href="/zh/resources/downloads" class="inline-block mt-5 ml-4 text-primary underline">查看采购清单</a></div>
</div></section>
<section class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-4xl"><h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold"><a class="text-primary underline" href="/zh/resources/blog/paprika-extract-format-selection">辣椒红：先选材料与供货形态</a></h2><p class="mt-4 text-gray-600">比较油基标准化提取物与水分散制剂，分别明确颜色与辣度要求。</p></div></section>
<RosemarySelection lang="zh" />
<IndustryResources lang="zh" industry="food" />
<section class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-4xl"><h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold"><a class="text-primary underline" href="/zh/resources/blog/chicory-fibre-selection">菊苣纤维：按配方任务选料</a></h2><p class="mt-4 text-gray-600">区分分散、溶解与质地构建，并按交付态纤维含量比较报价。</p></div></section>
<section data-cocoa-discovery class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-4xl"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold"><a class="underline text-primary" href="/zh/resources/blog/cocoa-selection">可可粉还是可可提取物？把巧克力风味与黄烷醇含量分开选</a></h2><p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">区分常规可可粉、保留黄烷醇的粉体与提取物，分别评价巧克力风味、组成和成品配方。</p></div></section>
<section data-ginger-discovery class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-4xl"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold"><a class="underline text-primary" href="/zh/resources/blog/ginger-selection">生姜原料怎么选：姜烯酚更高，不代表姜香更合适</a></h2><p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">把姜香与辛辣感分开选，结合干燥、提取和载体研究确认生姜原料的实际用途。</p></div></section>
<section data-beetroot-discovery class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-4xl"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold"><a class="underline text-primary" href="/zh/resources/blog/beetroot-product-formats">甜菜根粉怎么做成产品：三个亚马逊商品的不同思路</a></h2><p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">从三个卖家展示的甜菜商品，比较食品配料、大包装冲调与调味饮品的开发思路，不作功效或市场需求排名。</p></div></section>
<section data-beetroot-discovery class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-4xl"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold"><a class="underline text-primary" href="/zh/resources/blog/beet-colour-plant-based-meat">甜菜红植物肉烤后为什么还红？甜菜果胶与漆酶的变色思路</a></h2><p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">区分底色调整与烹调变色，解读甜菜红、甜菜果胶和漆酶研究中的植物肉配方、色度与使用边界。</p></div></section>
<section data-olive-pectin class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-4xl"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold"><a class="underline text-primary" href="/zh/resources/blog/olive-leaf-beverage-encapsulation">橄榄叶提取物用于酸性饮料：什么时候值得做脂质体包封？</a></h2><p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">结合橄榄叶粉末规格、三款真实商品配方与冷藏饮料研究，判断何时值得选择脂质体包封。</p></div></section>
<section data-olive-pectin class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-4xl"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold"><a class="underline text-primary" href="/zh/resources/blog/citrus-pectin-gel-selection">低糖柑橘果胶选型：同时匹配成胶时机、钙反应性与质构</a></h2><p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">对比七个具名柑橘果胶牌号、钙反应性与成胶过程，为低糖涂抹酱和酸化蛋白饮料选型。</p></div></section>
<section data-oat-apple class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-4xl"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold"><a class="underline text-primary" href="/zh/resources/blog/oat-beta-glucan-material-selection">饮料用燕麦β-葡聚糖：不要只按分子量选原料</a></h2><p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">结合历史检测数据、燕麦基质与现有商业原料，区分分子量、黏度和β-葡聚糖含量，为饮料选料。</p></div></section>
<section data-oat-apple class="section-padding"><div class="container-wide max-w-4xl"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold"><a class="underline text-primary" href="/zh/resources/blog/apple-extract-phloridzin-fibre-pectin">苹果多酚、根皮苷、苹果纤维与果胶：先分清原料，再比较含量</a></h2><p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">结合原始研究和供应商实例，区分苹果多酚提取物、根皮苷原料、功能性苹果纤维与果胶，读懂检测结果并选择合适的打样方向。</p></div></section>
</PageLayout>
